<script setup lang="ts">import{onMounted,computed}from 'vue';import{lab,load}from '../stores/research';import{useTask}from '../hooks/useTask';import{fmt,bearing}from '../utils/format';import PageHeading from '../components/common/PageHeading.vue';import ErrorNotice from '../components/common/ErrorNotice.vue';import PolarPlot from '../components/PolarPlot.vue';import StatusBadge from '../components/common/StatusBadge.vue';const{error,execute}=useTask(),latest=computed(()=>lab.runs.find(r=>r.status==='completed'));onMounted(()=>execute(load));</script><template><PageHeading index="01" title="先看见方向，再讨论差异。" text="圆周均值不等于普通角度平均。将跨零流向、双峰和集中度放到同一研究口径。"><RouterLink class="outline" to="/configure">建立流向研究 +</RouterLink></PageHeading><ErrorNotice :message="error" @retry="execute(load)"/><div v-if="latest?.result.a" class="overview-grid"><PolarPlot :a="latest.result.a" :b="latest.result.b"/><aside class="margin-reading"><p class="eyebrow">LATEST FIELD NOTE / {{latest.id}}</p><h2>{{latest.name}}</h2><p>同一调查期，两座固定浮标。先检查分布形状，再阅读均值方向。</p><dl><div><dt>A组圆周均值</dt><dd>{{bearing(latest.result.a.mean_bearing)}}</dd></div><div><dt>B组圆周均值</dt><dd>{{bearing(latest.result.b?.mean_bearing)}}</dd></div><div><dt>energy置换p</dt><dd>{{fmt(latest.result.energy?.p_value,4)}}</dd></div></dl><RouterLink :to="'/results?run='+latest.id" class="primary">读取完整研究 →</RouterLink><p class="margin-note">小p提示交换性前提下的分布差异，不给出成因，更不推出航行风险。</p></aside></div><div v-else class="empty">先建立研究，读取真实圆周分布和置换结果。</div><section class="register"><div class="section-title"><h2>调查索引</h2><span>{{lab.surveys.length}}期 / {{lab.moorings.length}}座固定浮标</span></div><div class="survey-list"><article v-for="s in lab.surveys"><p class="eyebrow">{{s.period}} / {{s.code}}</p><h3>{{s.name}}</h3><p>{{s.description}}</p><RouterLink :to="'/configure?survey='+s.id">打开调查 ↗</RouterLink></article></div></section><section class="register"><div class="section-title"><h2>近期研究</h2><span>原始输入指纹与置换seed均保留</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>研究</th><th>状态</th><th>样本 A / B</th><th>energy</th><th>置换p</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="r in lab.runs.slice(0,5)"><td>{{r.name}}</td><td><StatusBadge :status="r.status"/></td><td>{{r.result.a?.n||'—'}} / {{r.result.b?.n||'—'}}</td><td>{{fmt(r.result.energy?.statistic,4)}}</td><td>{{fmt(r.result.energy?.p_value,4)}}</td><td><RouterLink :to="'/results?run='+r.id">阅读 ↗</RouterLink></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></template>
